const e={id:"gs-vscode-terminal",title:{en:"VS Code, Extensions & Terminal Setup",hi:"VS Code, Pro Extensions & Terminal Setup"},difficulty:"Beginner",readTime:8,sections:[{id:"concept",type:"concept",heading:{en:"Configuring Your Development Command Center",hi:"Apna Professional Coding Environment Setup Karna"},body:{en:`**Visual Studio Code (VS Code)** by Microsoft is the undisputed industry-standard IDE for full-stack JavaScript engineering, used by over 74% of developers worldwide.

A raw VS Code installation is just a text editor. By installing the right extensions and configuring automatic linting and formatting on save, you transform it into a high-octane engineering cockpit that catches bugs before your code even runs.

### The 4 Essential Extensions for MERN:
1. **Prettier - Code Formatter**: Enforces consistent spacing, quotes, and indentation automatically every time you press \`Ctrl+S\` / \`Cmd+S\`.
2. **ESLint**: Catches unassigned variables, missing dependencies in React hooks, and common JavaScript bugs in real-time.
3. **Tailwind CSS IntelliSense**: Autocompletes class names, highlights color swatches, and warns about conflicting classes.
4. **GitLens**: Supercharges Git inside VS Code, showing who wrote each line and when.`,hi:`Microsoft ka **Visual Studio Code (VS Code)** duniya bhar ke full-stack developers ka sabse pasandeeda code editor hai.

Naya install kiya hua VS Code sirf ek plain text editor hota hai. Par jab aap sahi extensions aur format-on-save settings on karte hain, toh yeh ek powerful tool ban jata hai jo code run hone se pehle hi aapki galtiyan pakad leta hai.

### MERN Ke Liye 4 Sabse Zaroori Extensions:
1. **Prettier**: Jaise hi aap file save (\`Ctrl+S\`) karte hain, yeh code ko automatically sundar aur clean format kar deta hai.
2. **ESLint**: Code likhte waqt hi syntax errors, unused variables, aur React hooks ki galtiyon par red line dikha deta hai.
3. **Tailwind CSS IntelliSense**: Tailwind classes ko type karte waqt autocomplete suggestions deta hai.
4. **GitLens**: Har code line ke aage dikhata hai ki yeh line kisne aur kab commit ki thi.`},code:{language:"json",filename:".vscode/settings.json",snippet:`{
  "editor.formatOnSave": true,
  "editor.defaultFormatter": "esbenp.prettier-vscode",
  "editor.tabSize": 2,
  "editor.wordWrap": "on",
  "editor.codeActionsOnSave": {
    "source.fixAll.eslint": "explicit"
  },
  "files.autoSave": "onFocusChange"
}`}},{id:"why-it-matters",type:"concept",heading:{en:"Why Proper Tooling Multiplies Your Productivity",hi:"Proper Tooling Se Aapka Time Kaise Bachta Hai?"},body:{en:`Junior developers lose hours to:
- Missing commas or unmatched closing brackets
- Misspelled variable names
- Inconsistent spacing and indentation when collaborating with team members

When VS Code formats your code on save and ESLint highlights unused variables in bright red, 90% of silly typos are solved before you ever switch to your browser.`,hi:`Shuruati developers ka ghanton time isme barbaad hota hai:
- Bracket close karna bhool jana
- Variable ka naam galat type kar dena
- Indentation kharab hona

Jab VS Code save karte hi code auto-format kar deta hai aur ESLint galat variable par turant warning deta hai, toh 90% choti galtiyan bina kisi headache ke solve ho jaati hain.`}},{id:"analogy",type:"analogy",heading:{en:"The Master Chef's Kitchen Station",hi:"Master Chef Ka Kitchen Counter"},body:{en:`Imagine an Indian master chef in a 5-star hotel:
- A novice chef keeps blunt knives, hunts through messy cupboards for turmeric, and constantly cleans spilled oil with their hands.
- The master chef has razor-sharp German knives arranged by size, automated ingredient dispensers, and a clean workstation where tools return to their exact slots automatically.

Your VS Code setup is your kitchen workstation. Prettier and ESLint are your automatic sous-chefs keeping your workspace immaculate so you can focus 100% on high-level architecture.`,hi:`Ek 5-star hotel ke **Master Chef** ka example lijiye:
- Naya cook thukha chaku use karta hai, masale dhundne mein time lagata hai, aur counter ganda rakhta hai.
- Master chef ke paas tez chaku perfectly arranged hote hain, saaf counter hota hai, aur har cheez apni jagah par rehti hai.

Aapka VS Code aapka kitchen counter hai. Prettier aur ESLint aapke assistant cooks hain jo code ki safai ka dhyan rakhte hain taaki aapka poora focus business logic par rahe.`}},{id:"syntax",type:"syntax",heading:{en:"Essential Keyboard Shortcuts for Speed",hi:"Fast Coding Ke Liye Top Keyboard Shortcuts"},body:{en:"### The High-Frequency Shortcut Matrix\n\n| Action | Windows / Linux | Mac |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Quick File Search** | `Ctrl + P` | `Cmd + P` |\n| **Command Palette** | `Ctrl + Shift + P` | `Cmd + Shift + P` |\n| **Toggle Integrated Terminal** | `Ctrl + `` | `Ctrl + `` |\n| **Duplicate Line Down** | `Shift + Alt + Down` | `Shift + Option + Down` |\n| **Move Line Up / Down** | `Alt + Up / Down` | `Option + Up / Down` |\n| **Multi-Cursor Selection** | `Ctrl + D` | `Cmd + D` |\n| **Format Document** | `Shift + Alt + F` | `Shift + Option + F` |",hi:"### Top Keyboard Shortcuts\n\n| Kaam | Windows / Linux | Mac |\n|---|---|---|\n| **File Search** | `Ctrl + P` | `Cmd + P` |\n| **Command Palette** | `Ctrl + Shift + P` | `Cmd + Shift + P` |\n| **Integrated Terminal** | `Ctrl + `` | `Ctrl + `` |\n| **Line Duplicate** | `Shift + Alt + Down` | `Shift + Option + Down` |\n| **Line Move Up/Down** | `Alt + Up / Down` | `Option + Up / Down` |\n| **Multiple Cursor** | `Ctrl + D` | `Cmd + D` |\n| **Format Code** | `Shift + Alt + F` | `Shift + Option + F` |"}},{id:"examples",type:"example",heading:{en:"Example 1 (Basic): Prettier Configuration File",hi:"Example 1 (Basic): .prettierrc Configuration File"},body:{en:"Place a `.prettierrc` file at the root of your project so every team member's editor formats code identically:",hi:"Project ke root folder mein `.prettierrc` file rakhne se sabhi developers ka code same standard par format hota hai:"},code:{language:"json",filename:".prettierrc",snippet:`{
  "semi": true,
  "singleQuote": true,
  "tabWidth": 2,
  "trailingComma": "es5",
  "printWidth": 90,
  "bracketSpacing": true,
  "arrowParens": "always"
}`}},{id:"example-intermediate",type:"example",heading:{en:"Example 2 (Intermediate): Terminal Aliases for Superfast Navigation",hi:"Example 2 (Intermediate): Terminal Aliases (bashrc / zshrc)"},body:{en:"Save keystrokes every single day by adding these clean aliases to your `~/.bashrc` or `~/.zshrc`:",hi:"Rozana fast kaam karne ke liye apne terminal file (`~/.zshrc` ya `~/.bashrc`) mein yeh handy shortcuts add karein:"},code:{language:"bash",filename:"~/.zshrc",snippet:`# Git Shortcuts
alias gs="git status -s"
alias ga="git add ."
alias gc="git commit -m"
alias gp="git push origin main"

# Node & MERN Shortcuts
alias dev="npm run dev"
alias nstart="npm start"
alias ni="npm install"

# Navigation
alias c="clear"
alias ..="cd .."`}},{id:"example-real-world",type:"example",heading:{en:"Example 3 (Real-World): Full-Stack Debugger Launch Config",hi:"Example 3 (Real-World): Full-Stack Node.js Debugger Setup"},body:{en:"Stop relying on 20 `console.log` statements. This `launch.json` configuration allows you to set visual breakpoints directly inside your Express route handlers:",hi:"Console.log lagana band karein. Yeh configuration VS Code ke andar breakpoints lagane ki suvidha deti hai:"},code:{language:"json",filename:".vscode/launch.json",snippet:`{
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "configurations": [
    {
      "type": "node",
      "request": "launch",
      "name": "Debug Express Backend",
      "skipFiles": ["<node_internals>/**"],
      "program": "\${workspaceFolder}/server.js",
      "restart": true,
      "console": "integratedTerminal",
      "internalConsoleOptions": "neverOpen"
    }
  ]
}`}},{id:"mistakes",type:"mistakes",heading:{en:"Common Setup Mistakes & Pitfalls",hi:"Tools Setup Ki Common Galtiyan"},body:{en:"### 1. Running Terminal Commands in the Wrong Directory\n- **The Mistake**: Running `npm start` or `npm run dev` inside the parent folder instead of inside the project folder where `package.json` lives.\n- **The Error**: `npm ERR! code ENOENT: no such file or directory, open 'package.json'`.\n- **The Fix**: Always run `pwd` (Print Working Directory) and `ls` to verify you are in the folder containing `package.json`.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Conflicting Prettier and ESLint Rules\n- **The Mistake**: Prettier adding semicolons while ESLint throws red squiggles demanding no semicolons.\n- **The Fix**: Install `eslint-config-prettier` to turn off all ESLint formatting rules that conflict with Prettier.",hi:"### 1. Galat Directory Mein Command Chalana\n- **Problem**: `npm run dev` chalane par error aana: `ENOENT: no such file or directory open package.json`.\n- **Kyun Hota Hai**: Aap terminal mein project folder ke bahar khade hokar command chala rahe hain.\n- **Solution**: Hamesha `pwd` aur `ls` chalakar check karein ki aap usi folder mein hain jahan `package.json` file hai.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Prettier Aur ESLint Ke Rules Takrana\n- **Problem**: Prettier semicolon lagata hai aur ESLint use error batata hai.\n- **Solution**: Project mein `eslint-config-prettier` use karein taaki formatting ka kaam sirf Prettier sambhale."}},{id:"best-practices",type:"summary",heading:{en:"Pro Developer Best Practices",hi:"Pro Developer Best Practices"},body:{en:`- Enable **Format On Save** in VS Code settings.
- Use a monospaced programming font with ligatures (such as Fira Code or JetBrains Mono).
- Learn keyboard shortcuts to avoid reaching for the mouse every 30 seconds.
- Commit \`.vscode/settings.json\` to your repository so all collaborators share identical formatting.`,hi:`- VS Code mein **Format On Save** hamesha ON rakhein.
- Fira Code ya JetBrains Mono jaisa programming font use karein.
- Mouse ka use kam se kam karein aur keyboard shortcuts ki aadat dalein.
- \`.vscode/settings.json\` file ko repo mein save karein taaki team ka code consistent rahe.`}},{id:"interview",type:"interview",heading:{en:"Developer Tooling Interview Questions",hi:"Developer Environment Interview Questions"},body:{en:"Questions on code quality and tooling asked during team onboarding interviews:",hi:"Code quality aur tooling ke questions:"},questions:[{q:{en:"What is the difference between a Linter (ESLint) and a Formatter (Prettier)?",hi:"Linter (ESLint) aur Formatter (Prettier) mein kya farq hota hai?"},a:{en:"A Formatter (Prettier) only cares about visual styling: line length, indentation, quotes, and commas. It does not check if the code works. A Linter (ESLint) checks code quality and logic: detecting unused variables, potential null pointers, missing dependency arrays in React hooks, and syntax errors.",hi:"Formatter (Prettier) sirf code ke look (spacing, quotes, indentation) ko sundar banata hai. Linter (ESLint) code ke logic aur quality ko check karta hai—jaise unused variables, bugs, ya React hooks ke missing dependencies pakadna."},takeaway:{en:"Prettier fixes how code looks; ESLint fixes how code behaves.",hi:"Prettier code ko sundar banata hai; ESLint bugs pakadta hai."}}]},{id:"summary",type:"summary",heading:{en:"Quick Summary",hi:"Quick Summary"},body:{en:"- VS Code is the industry-standard IDE for full-stack MERN.\n- Essential extensions: Prettier, ESLint, Tailwind CSS IntelliSense, GitLens.\n- Always configure Format On Save in `settings.json`.\n- Learn terminal shortcuts (`Ctrl+P`, `Ctrl+``, `Cmd+D`) to accelerate workflow.",hi:`- VS Code MERN development ke liye best editor hai.
- Prettier, ESLint, aur Tailwind IntelliSense essential extensions hain.
- Format On Save setting hamesha enable rakhein.
- Keyboard shortcuts seekh kar apni coding speed 2x karein.`}}],quiz:[{q:{en:"What does the error 'npm ERR! code ENOENT: no such file or directory, open package.json' mean?",hi:"'npm ERR! code ENOENT: no such file or directory open package.json' ka kya matlab hota hai?"},options:[{en:"Your internet connection is disconnected",hi:"Aapka internet band hai"},{en:"You ran the npm command in a directory that does not contain a package.json file",hi:"Aapne command aisi directory mein chalayi hai jahan package.json file exist nahi karti"},{en:"VS Code needs to be uninstalled",hi:"VS Code ko uninstall karna padega"},{en:"Node.js only works on Linux",hi:"Node.js sirf Linux par kaam karta hai"}],answerIndex:1,explanation:{en:"npm looks for package.json in the current working directory. If you are in the wrong folder, it cannot find the file.",hi:"npm current folder mein package.json dhundta hai. Agar aap galat folder mein khade hain toh yeh error aata hai."}},{question:{en:"What is the core architectural purpose of VS Code, Extensions & Terminal Setup in the modern full-stack MERN ecosystem?",hi:"Modern full-stack MERN ecosystem mein VS Code, Pro Extensions & Terminal Setup ka mukhya architectural maksad kya hota hai?"},options:[{en:"It manages physical computer cooling and power supply",hi:"Ye physical computer cooling aur power supply manage karta hai"},{en:"It provides structured, robust, and scalable patterns for handling vs code, extensions & terminal setup with high performance and maintainability",hi:"Ye high performance aur maintainability ke saath VS Code, Pro Extensions & Terminal Setup ko handle karne ka structured aur scalable pattern provide karta hai"},{en:"It completely replaces JavaScript with binary machine code in browser tabs",hi:"Ye browser tabs mein JavaScript ko binary machine code se replace karta hai"},{en:"It is only used for printing documents to physical printers",hi:"Ye sirf physical printers par documents print karne ke liye hai"}],correctAnswer:1,explanation:{en:"VS Code, Extensions & Terminal Setup establishes clean separation of concerns, ensuring predictable data flow, robust error handling, and optimal runtime performance in production.",hi:"VS Code, Pro Extensions & Terminal Setup clean architecture aur separation of concerns deta hai jisse application scalable aur maintainable banti hai."}},{question:{en:"What critical development bottleneck or anti-pattern does VS Code, Extensions & Terminal Setup directly resolve?",hi:"VS Code, Pro Extensions & Terminal Setup kis critical development bottleneck ya anti-pattern ko seedhe solve karta hai?"},options:[{en:"It replaces chaotic, tightly coupled ad-hoc logic with declarative, predictable control flow and structured data contracts",hi:"Ye chaotic aur tightly coupled logic ko hata kar declarative, predictable flow aur structured data contracts deta hai"},{en:"It forces the operating system to shut down when errors occur",hi:"Error aane par ye operating system band kar deta hai"},{en:"It deletes all database records older than 24 hours automatically",hi:"Ye 24 ghante purane DB records delete karta hai"},{en:"It blocks all outgoing HTTP network requests to conserve bandwidth",hi:"Ye bandwidth bachane ke liye network requests block karta hai"}],correctAnswer:0,explanation:{en:"Without VS Code, Extensions & Terminal Setup, applications suffer from brittle code, maintenance overhead, and unhandled edge cases that manifest as production crashes.",hi:"VS Code, Pro Extensions & Terminal Setup ke bina code brittle ho jata hai aur production mein unexpected errors aate hain."}},{question:{en:"When reasoning about VS Code, Extensions & Terminal Setup, how is its mental model best conceptualized through real-world analogies?",hi:"VS Code, Pro Extensions & Terminal Setup ko real-world analogies ke zariye kaise best samjha ja sakta hai?"},options:[{en:"As a completely offline computer with zero network or database connections",hi:"Ek offline computer ki tarah jisme koi connection na ho"},{en:"As a disciplined, coordinated workflow where inputs are validated and processed through standardized checkpoints rather than ad-hoc handling",hi:"Ek disciplined workflow ki tarah jahan data ko structured checkpoints ke zariye step-by-step process kiya jata hai"},{en:"As a random number generator with non-deterministic output",hi:"Random number generator ki tarah jiska koi niyam na ho"},{en:"As a static text document that cannot be modified or read",hi:"Static text document jo padha na ja sake"}],correctAnswer:1,explanation:{en:"Real-world workflow analogies help engineers visualize component boundaries, request lifecycles, and data transformations intuitively.",hi:"Real-world analogies component boundaries aur request lifecycle ko visual aur intuitive banati hain."}},{question:{en:"When declaring and implementing VS Code, Extensions & Terminal Setup, what syntactic convention is essential to prevent runtime errors?",hi:"VS Code, Pro Extensions & Terminal Setup ko declare aur implement karte waqt kaunsa syntax niyam runtime errors rokne ke liye zaroori hai?"},options:[{en:"Adhering strictly to required parameters, handling asynchronous promises/callbacks cleanly, and verifying return value types",hi:"Zaroori parameters sahi pass karna, async promises ko handle karna aur return value types verify karna"},{en:"Wrapping every line of code inside an eval() execution block",hi:"Har line ko eval() block mein wrap karna"},{en:"Omitting import and require statements to reduce file size",hi:"File size ghatane ke liye import statements hatana"},{en:"Writing all code on a single continuous line without whitespace",hi:"Bina whitespace ke single line par code likhna"}],correctAnswer:0,explanation:{en:"Following standard ES6+ syntax contracts and properly handling promise resolution ensures execution safety and eliminates TypeError exceptions.",hi:"ES6+ syntax aur promise handling ke standard rules follow karne se TypeError aur crashes nahi aate."}},{question:{en:"What is a common pitfall developers encounter when working with VS Code, Extensions & Terminal Setup?",hi:"VS Code, Pro Extensions & Terminal Setup ke saath kaam karte waqt developers aksar kaunsi aam galati karte hain?"},options:[{en:"Writing unit tests before implementing features",hi:"Feature likhne se pehle unit tests likhna"},{en:"Failing to handle failure edge cases, mutating shared state directly, or neglecting defensive validation guard clauses",hi:"Failure edge cases ko handle na karna, shared state direct mutate karna ya validation guard clauses na lagana"},{en:"Using strict equality checks (===) instead of loose equality (==)",hi:"Loose equality ke badle strict equality use karna"},{en:"Writing clear inline code documentation",hi:"Clear inline code comments likhna"}],correctAnswer:1,explanation:{en:"Neglecting edge cases and error handling causes silent regressions and race conditions that surface under concurrent user workloads.",hi:"Edge cases aur error handling miss karne se high-traffic production load mein silent bugs paida hote hain."}},{question:{en:"According to production best practices, how should VS Code, Extensions & Terminal Setup be architected for enterprise-grade stability?",hi:"Production best practices ke mutabiq enterprise-grade stability ke liye VS Code, Pro Extensions & Terminal Setup ko kaise architect karna chahiye?"},options:[{en:"Enforce modular boundaries, validate all incoming payloads against schemas, log structured context, and maintain pure functions where possible",hi:"Modular boundaries enforce karein, payloads ko schema se validate karein, structured logs rakhein aur pure functions use karein"},{en:"Hardcode sensitive database connection strings directly in client-side files",hi:"Database passwords ko client files mein hardcode karna"},{en:"Disable all linter rules and type warnings globally",hi:"Linter aur type warnings ko globally disable karna"},{en:"Store all user session variables in global un-scoped memory arrays",hi:"Global memory arrays mein sessions store karna"}],correctAnswer:0,explanation:{en:"Enterprise-grade code prioritizes modularity, strict input validation, structured observability, and stateless designs.",hi:"Production hardening ke liye modular code, schema validation aur observability standard rules hote hain."}},{question:{en:"How does proper optimization of VS Code, Extensions & Terminal Setup impact application memory and CPU consumption?",hi:"VS Code, Pro Extensions & Terminal Setup ko sahi dhang se optimize karne par application memory aur CPU par kya asar padta hai?"},options:[{en:"It increases server CPU temperature to 100 degrees Celsius",hi:"Server CPU temperature 100 degrees kar deta hai"},{en:"It minimizes redundant computations, eliminates memory leaks from uncleaned references, and maintains low latency under high concurrency",hi:"Ye redundant computations ghatata hai, memory leaks khatam karta hai aur high concurrency mein low latency maintain karta hai"},{en:"It doubles heap RAM allocation unconditionally",hi:"Heap RAM ko zabardasti double karta hai"},{en:"Optimization has zero measurable impact in modern web engines",hi:"Modern web engines par optimization ka koi asar nahi hota"}],correctAnswer:1,explanation:{en:"Preventing unnecessary allocations and cleaning up resources ensures low garbage collection pressure and predictable response times.",hi:"Memory leak rokne aur unnecessary allocations hatane se Garbage Collector par load kam rehta hai aur response fast rehta hai."}},{question:{en:"What security principle is non-negotiable when handling data within VS Code, Extensions & Terminal Setup?",hi:"VS Code, Pro Extensions & Terminal Setup mein data handle karte waqt kaunsa security principle non-negotiable hota hai?"},options:[{en:"Never trust client-supplied input: always sanitize, authenticate, authorize, and validate against strict schemas on the server",hi:"Client data par blind trust na karein: server par hamesha sanitize, authenticate, authorize aur validate karein"},{en:"Trust all requests coming from mobile devices or web browsers blindly",hi:"Mobile ya browser se aane wali requests par blind trust karein"},{en:"Disable HTTPS and SSL certificates to maximize raw network throughput",hi:"Network throughput ke liye HTTPS band karein"},{en:"Expose database admin credentials to all registered users",hi:"Database admin credentials sabhi users ko expose karein"}],correctAnswer:0,explanation:{en:"Zero-Trust security dictates that every incoming request and data mutation must be validated and authenticated server-side before processing.",hi:"Zero-Trust security ke mutabiq har incoming mutation ko server par strictly validate aur authenticate kiya jana chahiye."}},{question:{en:"How does asynchronous non-blocking execution operate in VS Code, Extensions & Terminal Setup?",hi:"VS Code, Pro Extensions & Terminal Setup mein asynchronous non-blocking execution kaise kaam karta hai?"},options:[{en:"It freezes the entire operating system until each operation completes",hi:"Har operation complete hone tak operating system freeze rehta hai"},{en:"I/O operations return Promises or accept callbacks, delegating work to background threads/queues while the main thread remains free to handle incoming tasks",hi:"I/O operations Promises return karte hain aur background queues use karke main thread ko baaki requests ke liye free rakhte hain"},{en:"Async operations execute in reverse alphabetical order automatically",hi:"Async operations reverse alphabetical order mein chalte hain"},{en:"Async code only executes when triggered manually by a user click",hi:"Sirf manual user click par async code chalta hai"}],correctAnswer:1,explanation:{en:"Non-blocking asynchronous operations resolve via microtasks or event loop queues, ensuring the runtime thread serves concurrent requests smoothly.",hi:"Non-blocking model main thread ko free rakhta hai taaki server bina rukaawat ke multiple users ko simultaneously serve kar sake."}},{question:{en:"What is the recommended pattern for propagating errors that occur in VS Code, Extensions & Terminal Setup?",hi:"VS Code, Pro Extensions & Terminal Setup mein error aane par unhe propagate karne ka recommended pattern kya hai?"},options:[{en:"Intercepting the error, enriching it with operational context, and delegating to a centralized error handler or error boundary",hi:"Error ko intercept karna, debug context add karna, aur centralized error handler ya error boundary ko pass karna"},{en:"Swallowing errors silently with empty catch {} blocks to hide problems from logs",hi:"Khaali catch {} blocks se errors ko silently daba dena taaki logs mein na dikhein"},{en:"Shutting down the server machine power immediately",hi:"Server machine power turant band kar dena"},{en:"Sending internal raw stack traces and database credentials to end-user browsers",hi:"Raw stack trace aur DB passwords browser par bhej dena"}],correctAnswer:0,explanation:{en:"Centralized error propagation provides complete operational observability while shielding internal infrastructure details from end users.",hi:"Centralized error handling se system mein transparency rehti hai aur user ko clean, safe error messages milte hain."}},{question:{en:"When authoring unit or integration tests for VS Code, Extensions & Terminal Setup, what must the test suite assert?",hi:"VS Code, Pro Extensions & Terminal Setup ke liye automated tests likhte waqt test suite ko kya assert karna zaroori hai?"},options:[{en:"Only that the JavaScript file can be saved to disk",hi:"Sirf ye ki file disk par save ho sake"},{en:"Both the happy path (expected inputs producing valid outputs) AND boundary edge cases (null, empty arrays, network timeouts, invalid types)",hi:"Happy path (valid data) AUR boundary edge cases (null, empty array, network timeout, invalid types) dono ko verify karna"},{en:"That the test suite takes at least 24 hours to finish running",hi:"Test suite ko 24 ghante chalna chahiye"},{en:"Testing is considered unnecessary in modern full-stack development",hi:"Modern development mein testing zaroori nahi hai"}],correctAnswer:1,explanation:{en:"Robust automated test suites verify both standard valid scenarios and defensive failure modes to prevent regressions during deployments.",hi:"Achhi testing valid inputs aur failure states dono ko assert karti hai taaki production deployments safe rahein."}},{question:{en:"How does modular design enhance code maintainability in VS Code, Extensions & Terminal Setup?",hi:"Modular design VS Code, Pro Extensions & Terminal Setup mein code maintainability ko kaise badhata hai?"},options:[{en:"By isolating distinct responsibilities into small, reusable, and independently testable units following the Single Responsibility Principle",hi:"Single Responsibility Principle ke zariye alag-alag kaamo ko chote, reusable aur testable units mein baant kar"},{en:"By combining all frontend, backend, and database code into a single 50,000-line script",hi:"Saara code ek hi 50,000-line script mein daal kar"},{en:"By removing all function names and replacing them with random numbers",hi:"Function names hata kar random numbers likhna"},{en:"By forbidding code comments and documentation across the repository",hi:"Comments aur documentation ban kar dena"}],correctAnswer:0,explanation:{en:"Modularity reduces cognitive load, simplifies debugging, prevents ripple effects during changes, and enables seamless team collaboration.",hi:"Modular code se readability badhti hai, debugging aasan hoti hai aur ek jagah badlav karne par doosri jagah bugs nahi aate."}},{question:{en:"When application traffic scales 100x, how should VS Code, Extensions & Terminal Setup be architected to support horizontal scaling?",hi:"Traffic 100x badhne par VS Code, Pro Extensions & Terminal Setup ko horizontally scale karne ke liye kya design approach honi chahiye?"},options:[{en:"Ensure the component/service is completely stateless, offload shared session/state to Redis/MongoDB, and distribute traffic via a load balancer",hi:"Service ko completely stateless banayein, shared state ko Redis/DB par shift karein aur load balancer se traffic distribute karein"},{en:"Store all user session variables in local in-memory JavaScript objects on the web server",hi:"Server ki local RAM mein session variables store karna"},{en:"Reboot the production server manually whenever memory usage exceeds 10%",hi:"Memory 10% cross hote hi server manually reboot karna"},{en:"Block 95% of incoming users using firewall rules",hi:"95% users ko firewall se block kar dena"}],correctAnswer:0,explanation:{en:"Stateless service architecture guarantees that any container instance can handle any incoming request, enabling dynamic auto-scaling without session loss.",hi:"Stateless architecture auto-scaling ka base hai jahan naye containers bina session loss ke instant traffic handle kar sakte hain."}},{question:{en:"In the full-stack MERN paradigm, where does VS Code, Extensions & Terminal Setup properly belong and execute?",hi:"Full-stack MERN architecture mein VS Code, Pro Extensions & Terminal Setup kahan belong karta hai aur kahan execute hota hai?"},options:[{en:"In its designated architectural tier (Client browser UI, Express API backend, or MongoDB database) with clean API contracts connecting them",hi:"Apne designated tier (Browser UI, Express API backend, ya MongoDB) mein clean API contracts ke saath"},{en:"Directly on the end-user's local router firmware",hi:"User ke local router firmware par"},{en:"Inside the computer motherboard BIOS chip",hi:"Motherboard BIOS chip mein"},{en:"All MERN code runs strictly inside the MongoDB database engine",hi:"Saara MERN code sirf MongoDB ke andar chalta hai"}],correctAnswer:0,explanation:{en:"Maintaining clear structural boundaries between client rendering, backend orchestration, and database persistence is the defining trait of MERN.",hi:"Client UI, backend server aur database ke beech saaf boundary maintain karna MERN architecture ka mukhya niyam hai."}},{question:{en:"What telemetry metric or observability signal is most crucial for diagnosing issues with VS Code, Extensions & Terminal Setup in production?",hi:"Production mein VS Code, Pro Extensions & Terminal Setup ki problems diagnose karne ke liye sabse zaroori telemetry metric kaunsi hoti hai?"},options:[{en:"The desktop monitor brightness setting of the client",hi:"Client ke monitor ki brightness"},{en:"Latency percentiles (p95/p99), error rates (HTTP 4xx/5xx), throughput (RPS), and heap memory allocation deltas",hi:"Latency percentiles (p95/p99), error rates (4xx/5xx), throughput (RPS), aur heap memory allocation deltas"},{en:"The number of files in the project's root folder",hi:"Root folder mein files ki sankhya"},{en:"The physical keyboard model used by the engineer",hi:"Engineer ke keyboard ka model"}],correctAnswer:1,explanation:{en:"Observability platforms monitor p95/p99 latencies, error frequencies, and memory utilization to identify bottlenecks and regressions early.",hi:"p95/p99 latencies aur error rates monitor karne se crashes aane se pehle hi bottlenecks pakad mein aa jaate hain."}},{question:{en:"Why is eliminating unintended side effects essential when authoring logic for VS Code, Extensions & Terminal Setup?",hi:"VS Code, Pro Extensions & Terminal Setup ka logic likhte waqt unintended side effects ko khatam karna kyun zaroori hai?"},options:[{en:"Side effects introduce unpredictability, corrupt shared state, cause race conditions, and make concurrent code nearly impossible to debug",hi:"Side effects se code unpredictable banta hai, shared state corrupt hoti hai aur race conditions create hoti hain"},{en:"Side effects permanently erase the developer's Git commit history",hi:"Git history permanently delete ho jaati hai"},{en:"Side effects are strictly required by the JavaScript ECMAScript standard",hi:"ECMAScript mein side effects required hain"},{en:"Side effects make all algorithms execute in O(1) time",hi:"Saare algorithms O(1) time mein chalte hain"}],correctAnswer:0,explanation:{en:"Pure and predictable logic produces the same output for identical inputs, guaranteeing thread safety, easy caching, and high reliability.",hi:"Pure logic se shared state safe rehti hai aur same input par hamesha consistent aur predictable output milta hai."}},{question:{en:"How should client-side state be kept in sync with backend server mutations in VS Code, Extensions & Terminal Setup?",hi:"VS Code, Pro Extensions & Terminal Setup mein client-side state aur backend server data ko sync mein kaise rakha jata hai?"},options:[{en:"By forcing a complete hard page refresh every 3 seconds",hi:"Har 3 second mein poora page hard refresh karke"},{en:"Using optimistic UI updates with error rollback, automated query cache invalidation (TanStack Query/RTK), or WebSocket change streams",hi:"Optimistic UI updates with rollback, automated query cache invalidation ya WebSocket push streams use karke"},{en:"By disabling all database update operations permanently",hi:"Database updates ko permanently band karke"},{en:"By saving user state in local CSV files on the server desktop",hi:"Server desktop par CSV files save karke"}],correctAnswer:1,explanation:{en:"Modern full-stack architectures synchronize state seamlessly using query cache invalidation, optimistic updates, and real-time socket events.",hi:"Modern apps cache invalidation aur optimistic UI use karti hain taaki UI bina screen reload ke instantly updated rahe."}},{question:{en:"Why is thorough resource cleanup (clearing timers, closing sockets, aborting in-flight requests) critical in VS Code, Extensions & Terminal Setup?",hi:"VS Code, Pro Extensions & Terminal Setup mein resource cleanup (timers clear karna, sockets band karna, network abort karna) kyun zaroori hai?"},options:[{en:"To prevent memory leaks where unreachable or orphaned objects remain retained in heap memory, causing gradual performance degradation and crashes",hi:"Memory leaks rokne ke liye taaki unneeded objects RAM mein jama na hon aur server crash na ho"},{en:"To delete the client's local disk partition",hi:"Client ka local disk partition delete karne ke liye"},{en:"Because JavaScript engines allow only 5 variables in RAM",hi:"JS engine sirf 5 variables allow karta hai"},{en:"Cleanup is unnecessary because garbage collection handles 100% of event listeners automatically",hi:"Cleanup ki zaroorat nahi hoti"}],correctAnswer:0,explanation:{en:"Unclosed connections and dangling event listeners create references that prevent garbage collection, leading to severe memory leaks over time.",hi:"Dangling listeners aur unclosed connections memory leaks banate hain jo V8 heap ko exhaust karke process crash kar dete hain."}},{question:{en:"What principle enables VS Code, Extensions & Terminal Setup to operate identically across local dev, staging, and production environments?",hi:"VS Code, Pro Extensions & Terminal Setup ko local dev, staging aur production mein bilkul same operate karne ke liye kaunsa niyam zaroori hai?"},options:[{en:"Twelve-Factor App methodology: injecting all environment-specific configurations and credentials via environment variables rather than hardcoded code",hi:"Twelve-Factor niyam: environment variables se dynamic configuration aur credentials inject karna bina code badle"},{en:"Manually rewriting the codebase before deploying to each server",hi:"Har server par deploy karne se pehle naya code likhna"},{en:"Hosting development and production on the same physical developer laptop",hi:"Ek hi laptop par dev aur prod dono host karna"},{en:"Disabling all security authentications in production environments",hi:"Production mein saari security band kar dena"}],correctAnswer:0,explanation:{en:"Decoupling configuration from executable code allows identical, immutable container images to run reliably across all deployment stages.",hi:"Config aur code ko alag rakhne se ek hi build image bina kisi bug ke kisi bhi cloud platform par chal sakti hai."}},{question:{en:"When an unexpected outage or regression occurs in production involving VS Code, Extensions & Terminal Setup, what is the first engineering step?",hi:"Production mein VS Code, Pro Extensions & Terminal Setup se related outage ya regression aane par pehla engineering step kya hona chahiye?"},options:[{en:"Immediately delete all production databases without backups",hi:"Bina backup ke production database delete kar dena"},{en:"Check centralized observability logs and error stack traces, correlate request IDs, reproduce locally with minimal test cases, and isolate the root cause",hi:"Centralized observability logs aur stack traces check karna, request ID correlate karna, aur locally minimal test cases se reproduce karna"},{en:"Blame the operating system without inspecting any server logs",hi:"Bina log dekhe OS ko blame karna"},{en:"Wait several days hoping the system resolves itself",hi:"Kai din intezar karna"}],correctAnswer:1,explanation:{en:"Disciplined engineering incident response begins with analyzing structured logs, tracing request flow, and isolating reproducible root causes.",hi:"Disciplined debugging structured logs aur request correlation ID dekh kar root cause isolate karne se shuru hoti hai."}}]};export{e as default};
